ldren":[{"type":"text","value":"tableOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/SolidTable.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SolidTable"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const table = createTable(\n  {\n    features,\n    columns,\n    data,\n  },\n)","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-createtable","text":"Function: createTable()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tableoptions","text":"tableOptions","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: createTable()\n\n```ts\nfunction createTable<TFeatures, TData>(tableOptions): SolidTable<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createTable.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/solid-table/src/createTable.ts#L64)\n\nCreates a Solid table instance backed by Solid-aware TanStack Store atoms.\n\nTable APIs and atom reads participate in Solid dependency tracking, so\ncomputations that read a specific slice can update without invalidating\nunrelated UI. Read table APIs or atoms inside JSX, `createMemo`, or\n`createEffect` to track updates.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### tableOptions\n\n`TableOptions`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SolidTable`](../type-aliases/SolidTable.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst table = createTable(\n  {\n    features,\n    columns,\n    data,\n  },\n)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createTable\ntitle: createTable\n---\n\n# Function: createTable()\n\n```ts\nfunction createTable<TFeatures, TData>(tableOptions): SolidTable<TFeatures, TData>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createTable.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/solid-table/src/createTable.ts#L64)\n\nCreates a Solid table instance backed by Solid-aware TanStack Store atoms.\n\nTable APIs and atom reads participate in Solid dependency tracking, so\ncomputations that read a specific slice can update without invalidating\nunrelated UI. Read table APIs or atoms inside JSX, `createMemo`, or\n`createEffect` to track updates.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### tableOptions\n\n`TableOptions`\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SolidTable`](../type-aliases/SolidTable.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst table = createTable(\n  {\n    features,\n    columns,\n    data,\n  },\n)\n```\n"}
